    {
      "paperId": "/chapter/10.1007/978-981-97-3340-8_52",
      "doi": "10.1007/978-981-97-3340-8_52",
      "title": "An Observer-Based Anti-unwinding Attitude Control Method for Flexible Spacecraft",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Binwen Yuan, Rui-Qi Dong, Deng Yang"
        }
      ],
      "year": 2024,
      "abstract": "In this paper, the anti-unwinding attitude controller design for flexible spacecraft in the presence of flexible vibration, inertia uncertainty, and environmental disturbance torques is considered and a novel flexible modal observer-based anti-unwinding attitude control method is proposed. First, two adaptive laws are designed to deal with inertia uncertainty and environmental disturbance torques. Then, a flexible modal observer and an observer-based controller are designed. It is proven that the closed-loop system under the proposed controller is asymptotically stable. The simulation results validate that the proposed control method achieves a good tracking performance and is feasible subject to flexible vibration, inertia uncertainty, and environmental disturbance torques.",
